# R25 measurement harness output. tests/perf/*.mjs (mount-cost, profile, micro,
# module-graph) are run BY HAND during a performance RCA and write their raw
# timings here. The numbers are machine- and load-specific, so committing them
# would be committing noise that no gate reads. The harness scripts themselves
# ARE committed - they are how a future RCA reproduces the measurement.
tests/perf/results/

# R31 verification artifacts: theme screenshots and the throwaway Playwright
# drivers that produced them. Machine-specific pixels, regenerated on demand —
# committing them would be committing noise no gate reads.
.artifacts/
